      "content": "idk im just really nervous about going back to the hospital so much lol. it doesn't even hurt that bad, it just feels heavy. my surgeon said swelling was expected. u sure it cant just be inflammation from the procedure? i dont wanna be a bother if its just part of the healing process.",
